Generic single-database configuration.

#### Alembic Docs
Creating a new schema via Alembic:                                                                                      
                                                                                                                          
  .venv/bin/alembic revision -m "add silver schema"                                                                       

Then apply it:                                                                                                          
  .venv/bin/alembic upgrade head

Undo the most recent migration
.venv/bin/alembic downgrade -1                                                                                          

Undo back to a specific revision ID                                                                                   
.venv/bin/alembic downgrade 2076e9afa11f              
                                                                                                                        
Undo everything (back to empty DB)                                                                                    
.venv/bin/alembic downgrade base